<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it raised its 1996 earnings per share view on Intel Corp to $4.60 from $4.53 and its 1997 EPS view to $5.75 from $5.50.</p>
<p>-- It said it raised its 12-month price target for the stock to $100.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 85-1/8.</p>
</text>
